nodes.body:
Thanks for the suggestion!

@zyongye, could you take a look at this DSv4.1 prefill Top-K/SWA index-combination optimization? The final selector uses one token per program for Top-K and two for SWA-only, while preserving exact integer output semantics and writing full sentinel padding. In the tested B300 16K/ratio2 cold-L2 combine benchmark, latency decreased from 49.152 to 20.480 µs.

Correctness coverage, model measurements, and the remaining validation gaps are documented in the PR description. I would appreciate your feedback on the kernel design, dispatch choice, and any additional workloads you would like covered. Thanks!

